BattleChess is an unofficial reverse-engineering and native recompilation project.
It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the original game or system-software
rights holders. Function provenance is retained in source comments.

The MIT license covers project contributions to the extent the contributors can
license them. It does not grant rights to original Battle Chess code or data,
Apple fonts, or other third-party material. This project is not a clean-room
implementation. Original binaries, disk images, standalone game-asset packs,
fonts, and extracted resource tables are not distributed in this repository.

Documentation screenshots depict original game artwork loaded from a separate
local data pack. Those depicted resources remain outside the MIT license. The
project knight icon is new artwork generated for this recompilation; its
provenance is recorded in resources/ICON.md.
